    "brief": "Let the orchestrator add 'Carry: dismissed: <reason>' or 'Carry: <group>' under its own identity, keyed to the verdict's head SHA and read back, without a review. Touches carry_audit.py, so it is reviewed after #2571 (merged 94612a9b2). Evidence: the four markers-only re-reads (#2547, #2580, #2578, #2569) dismissed every item and routed none.",
